{"id":"d10d9b145ddecdaa","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-polymorphic-signature.md","title":"df-polymorphic-signature","display":"df-polymorphic-signature","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-polymorphic-signature","aliases":["16-df-polymorphic-signature","Polymorphic signature"],"display":"df-polymorphic-signature","depends_on":["[[16-df-stlc-syntax]]","[[16-df-algebraic-signature]]"],"source":"Definition 8.1.1 p.449 (PDF 469); explicit two-level presentation","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-polymorphic-signature"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-polymorphic-signature</span><span>Polymorphic signature</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-polymorphic-signature"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"435152fdfa38036a\" href=\"?note=435152fdfa38036a\" title=\"16-df-stlc-syntax\">16-df-stlc-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"afcc53893d447b1b\" href=\"?note=afcc53893d447b1b\" title=\"16-df-algebraic-signature\">16-df-algebraic-signature</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 8.1.1 p.449 (PDF 469); explicit two-level presentation"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_0\">\\(K_0\\)</span> 为原子 kind 集且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Type}\\in K_0\">\\(\\mathrm{Type}\\in K_0\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(K_0)\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(K_0)\\)</span>、有限元常量签名及其项判断采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"435152fdfa38036a\" href=\"?note=435152fdfa38036a\" title=\"16-df-stlc-syntax\">16-df-stlc-syntax</a>，在此把“简单类型”解释为 kind、“项”解释为 kind 的项。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 为 kind 层函数符号集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}_K\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}_K\\)</span> 为其候选型属数据；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_K=\\langle K_0,C,\\operatorname{ar}_K,\\varnothing\\rangle\">\\(\\Sigma_K=\\langle K_0,C,\\operatorname{ar}_K,\\varnothing\\rangle\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=(A_1,\\ldots,A_n)\">\\(a=(A_1,\\ldots,A_n)\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_0^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(K_0^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_a=(x_1:A_1,\\ldots,x_n:A_n)\">\\(\\Gamma_a=(x_1:A_1,\\ldots,x_n:A_n)\\)</span> 仅是上游位置语境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_1,\\ldots,A_n)\">\\((A_1,\\ldots,A_n)\\)</span> 的显示简写；变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i\">\\(x_i\\)</span> 指位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_a\">\\(D_a\\)</span> 为 type 层函数符号集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{in}_a,\\operatorname{out}_a\">\\(\\operatorname{in}_a,\\operatorname{out}_a\\)</span> 为候选型属映射；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\langle\\Sigma_K,(D_a,\\operatorname{in}_a,\\operatorname{out}_a)_{a\\in K_0^{&lt;\\omega}}\\rangle\">\\(S=\\langle\\Sigma_K,(D_a,\\operatorname{in}_a,\\operatorname{out}_a)_{a\\in K_0^{&lt;\\omega}}\\rangle\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_a\">\\(T_a\\)</span> 为下式给出的<strong>项表达式</strong>集合，不额外按 β/η 取商；项树按上游的位置变量语法编码。对第一／第二阶分支，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}_K(c)=(a_K(c),b_K(c))\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}_K(c)=(a_K(c),b_K(c))\\)</span> 的分量限于原子 kind，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_K^{\\mathrm{alg}}=\\langle K_0,C,a_K,b_K\\rangle\">\\(\\Sigma_K^{\\mathrm{alg}}=\\langle K_0,C,a_K,b_K\\rangle\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"afcc53893d447b1b\" href=\"?note=afcc53893d447b1b\" title=\"16-df-algebraic-signature\">16-df-algebraic-signature</a> 的普通项树形成规则。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolySig}\">\\(\\mathrm{PolySig}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolySig}_{1,2}\">\\(\\mathrm{PolySig}_{1,2}\\)</span> 在本页定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Kind}_{\\Sigma_K}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(K_0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{KindSig}(\\Sigma_K)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ar}_K:C\\to\\operatorname{Kind}_{\\Sigma_K}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\operatorname{Kind}_{\\Sigma_K},\\\\\nT_a&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\sigma\\mid\\Gamma_a\\vdash_{\\Sigma_K}\\sigma:\\mathrm{Type}\\}&amp;\\operatorname{KindSig}(\\Sigma_K),\\\\\n\\varnothing&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{KindSig}(\\Sigma_K),\n\\end{cases},\\\\\n\\operatorname{TySig}(D_a,\\operatorname{in}_a,\\operatorname{out}_a;T_a)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{in}_a:D_a\\to T_a^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\operatorname{out}_a:D_a\\to T_a,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PolySig}(S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{KindSig}(\\Sigma_K)\\land\n(\\forall a\\in K_0^{&lt;\\omega})\\ \\operatorname{TySig}(D_a,\\operatorname{in}_a,\\operatorname{out}_a;T_a),\\\\\nT_a^{1,2}&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{\\Sigma_K^{\\mathrm{alg}}}(a,\\mathrm{Type})&amp;\\operatorname{ar}_K:C\\to K_0^{&lt;\\omega}\\times K_0,\\\\\n\\varnothing&amp;\\neg(\\operatorname{ar}_K:C\\to K_0^{&lt;\\omega}\\times K_0),\n\\end{cases},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PolySig}_{1,2}(S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow K_0=\\{\\mathrm{Type}\\}\\land\\operatorname{ar}_K:C\\to K_0^{&lt;\\omega}\\times K_0\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall a\\in K_0^{&lt;\\omega})\\ \\operatorname{TySig}(D_a,\\operatorname{in}_a,\\operatorname{out}_a;T_a^{1,2}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ClosedTy}_{\\Sigma_K}&amp;\\coloneqq T_{()}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Kind}_{\\Sigma_K}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(K_0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{KindSig}(\\Sigma_K)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ar}_K:C\\to\\operatorname{Kind}_{\\Sigma_K}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\operatorname{Kind}_{\\Sigma_K},\\\\\nT_a&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\sigma\\mid\\Gamma_a\\vdash_{\\Sigma_K}\\sigma:\\mathrm{Type}\\}&amp;\\operatorname{KindSig}(\\Sigma_K),\\\\\n\\varnothing&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{KindSig}(\\Sigma_K),\n\\end{cases},\\\\\n\\operatorname{TySig}(D_a,\\operatorname{in}_a,\\operatorname{out}_a;T_a)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{in}_a:D_a\\to T_a^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\operatorname{out}_a:D_a\\to T_a,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PolySig}(S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{KindSig}(\\Sigma_K)\\land\n(\\forall a\\in K_0^{&lt;\\omega})\\ \\operatorname{TySig}(D_a,\\operatorname{in}_a,\\operatorname{out}_a;T_a),\\\\\nT_a^{1,2}&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{\\Sigma_K^{\\mathrm{alg}}}(a,\\mathrm{Type})&amp;\\operatorname{ar}_K:C\\to K_0^{&lt;\\omega}\\times K_0,\\\\\n\\varnothing&amp;\\neg(\\operatorname{ar}_K:C\\to K_0^{&lt;\\omega}\\times K_0),\n\\end{cases},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PolySig}_{1,2}(S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow K_0=\\{\\mathrm{Type}\\}\\land\\operatorname{ar}_K:C\\to K_0^{&lt;\\omega}\\times K_0\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall a\\in K_0^{&lt;\\omega})\\ \\operatorname{TySig}(D_a,\\operatorname{in}_a,\\operatorname{out}_a;T_a^{1,2}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ClosedTy}_{\\Sigma_K}&amp;\\coloneqq T_{()}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Definition 8.1.1 p.449（PDF469）。本页内建二层签名的实际接口：kind signature 决定每个 kind context 中可作 type 的表达式集合；该集合再作为对应 ordinary type signature 的排序集。第一／第二阶由独立的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_a^{1,2}\">\\(T_a^{1,2}\\)</span> 分支明确限制为 Type 上的普通变量与已声明 kind 操作，不把新生成的 kind 1、×、→ 当作 λ→／λ2 的额外可量化 kind；λω 才使用完整的 kind 构造。用有限元操作表示函数符号是上游 STLC 签名的本地呈现，零元符号也包括在内。</p>\n<p>先前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,D,\\operatorname{ar},\\operatorname{ty})\">\\((C,D,\\operatorname{ar},\\operatorname{ty})\\)</span> 只给“闭多态常元”，既漏逐 kind context 的普通签名，也漏 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1,\\times,\\to\">\\(1,\\times,\\to\\)</span> 等形成条件，不能作为原书 Definition8.1.1。这里保留 PolySig 名称但更正其结构参数；本目录搜索未发现旧元组或 ar/ty 的实际下游调用。原书的 List／Tree、nil／cons 例子分别属于这两个签名层。完整带任意该签名的 λω 推导仍需进一步连接，本页不声称仅靠签名已得到其所有规则。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-stlc-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"435152fdfa38036a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-stlc-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-algebraic-signature","status":"resolved","id":"afcc53893d447b1b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-algebraic-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-stlc-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"435152fdfa38036a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K_0$ 为原子 kind 集且 $\\mathrm{Type}\\in K_0$。$\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(K_0)$、有限元常量签名及其项判断采用 [[16-df-stlc-syntax]]，在此把“简单类型”解释为 kind、“项”解释为 kind 的项。$C$ 为 kind 层函数符号集，$\\operatorname{ar}_K$ 为其候选型属数据；$\\Sigma_K=\\langle K_0,C,\\operatorname{ar}_K,\\varnothing\\rangle$。$a=(A_1,\\ldots,A_n)$ 遍历 $K_0^{<\\omega}$，$\\Gamma_a=(x_1:A_1,\\ldots,x_n:A_n)$ 仅是上游位置语境 $(A_1,\\ldots,A_n)$ 的显示简写；变量 $x_i$ 指位置 $i$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-algebraic-signature","status":"resolved","id":"afcc53893d447b1b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"对每个 $a$，$D_a$ 为 type 层函数符号集，$\\operatorname{in}_a,\\operatorname{out}_a$ 为候选型属映射；$S=\\langle\\Sigma_K,(D_a,\\operatorname{in}_a,\\operatorname{out}_a)_{a\\in K_0^{<\\omega}}\\rangle$。$T_a$ 为下式给出的**项表达式**集合，不额外按 β/η 取商；项树按上游的位置变量语法编码。对第一／第二阶分支，$\\operatorname{ar}_K(c)=(a_K(c),b_K(c))$ 的分量限于原子 kind，$\\Sigma_K^{\\mathrm{alg}}=\\langle K_0,C,a_K,b_K\\rangle$ 使用 [[16-df-algebraic-signature]] 的普通项树形成规则。$\\mathrm{PolySig}$ 和 $\\mathrm{PolySig}_{1,2}$ 在本页定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"K_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Type}\\in K_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(K_0)","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}_K","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_K=\\langle K_0,C,\\operatorname{ar}_K,\\varnothing\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"a=(A_1,\\ldots,A_n)","display":false},{"tex":"K_0^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_a=(x_1:A_1,\\ldots,x_n:A_n)","display":false},{"tex":"(A_1,\\ldots,A_n)","display":false},{"tex":"x_i","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"D_a","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{in}_a,\\operatorname{out}_a","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\langle\\Sigma_K,(D_a,\\operatorname{in}_a,\\operatorname{out}_a)_{a\\in K_0^{<\\omega}}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"T_a","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}_K(c)=(a_K(c),b_K(c))","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_K^{\\mathrm{alg}}=\\langle K_0,C,a_K,b_K\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolySig}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolySig}_{1,2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Kind}_{\\Sigma_K}&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(K_0),\\\\\n\\operatorname{KindSig}(\\Sigma_K)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ar}_K:C\\to\\operatorname{Kind}_{\\Sigma_K}^{<\\omega}\\times\\operatorname{Kind}_{\\Sigma_K},\\\\\nT_a&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\sigma\\mid\\Gamma_a\\vdash_{\\Sigma_K}\\sigma:\\mathrm{Type}\\}&\\operatorname{KindSig}(\\Sigma_K),\\\\\n\\varnothing&\\neg\\operatorname{KindSig}(\\Sigma_K),\n\\end{cases},\\\\\n\\operatorname{TySig}(D_a,\\operatorname{in}_a,\\operatorname{out}_a;T_a)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{in}_a:D_a\\to T_a^{<\\omega}\\land\\operatorname{out}_a:D_a\\to T_a,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PolySig}(S)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{KindSig}(\\Sigma_K)\\land\n(\\forall a\\in K_0^{<\\omega})\\ \\operatorname{TySig}(D_a,\\operatorname{in}_a,\\operatorname{out}_a;T_a),\\\\\nT_a^{1,2}&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{\\Sigma_K^{\\mathrm{alg}}}(a,\\mathrm{Type})&\\operatorname{ar}_K:C\\to K_0^{<\\omega}\\times K_0,\\\\\n\\varnothing&\\neg(\\operatorname{ar}_K:C\\to K_0^{<\\omega}\\times K_0),\n\\end{cases},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PolySig}_{1,2}(S)&\\Longleftrightarrow K_0=\\{\\mathrm{Type}\\}\\land\\operatorname{ar}_K:C\\to K_0^{<\\omega}\\times K_0\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(\\forall a\\in K_0^{<\\omega})\\ \\operatorname{TySig}(D_a,\\operatorname{in}_a,\\operatorname{out}_a;T_a^{1,2}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ClosedTy}_{\\Sigma_K}&\\coloneqq T_{()}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T_a^{1,2}","display":false},{"tex":"(C,D,\\operatorname{ar},\\operatorname{ty})","display":false},{"tex":"1,\\times,\\to","display":false}],"bytes":4101,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-110","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-stlc-syntax]]、[[16-df-stlc-syntactic-category]]、[[16-df-simple-type-semantics]]、[[16-thm-categorical-completeness]]、[[16-df-lambda-systems]]、[[16-df-polymorphic-signature]]、[[16-df-hagino-functor]]、[[16-thm-weak-initial-algebra]]、[[16-ex-church-weak-nno]]、[[16-df-polymorphic-fibration]]、[[16-df-lambda-fibrations]]。"}],"outgoing":["435152fdfa38036a","afcc53893d447b1b"]}